# data/ holds everything training produces. Track results, not process:
# champions, hall-of-fame checkpoints, summaries and the small baselines tests
# need. Per-generation history, optimizer state, work caches, watch pages,
# binaries, packages and replays stay untracked.
*
!*/
!.gitignore

# Notes and reports
!*.md

# Champions and checkpoints of champions
!champion*.json
!brain.best.json
!brain.initial.json
!brain.reference.json

# Outcome of a run or campaign
!summary.json
!campaign.json
!receipt.json
!evolve.log

# Baselines and inputs that tests and README commands read
!brains/from_replays/**
brains/from_replays/runs/**
brains/from_replays/catalog.expanded*.json

# Never track bulky or reproducible trees, even if a name above matches
packages/
campaign-package-*/
**/work/
**/bin/
**/assets/
**/final/watch*.html
**/rounds/
